# Graphviz DOT: The DOT Language (graphviz.org/doc/info/lang.html); requirements/languages/dot.md
name     dot graphviz gv
keyword  graph digraph subgraph node edge strict
builtin  label shape color style fillcolor rankdir fontname box ellipse filled dashed
fold-case
line-comment   // #
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   < >  : multiline
operators  ->=;,[]{}
